Python REPL:
1. {"action": "open", "command": "python3", "args": ["-i"]}
   → Returns session_id
2. {"action": "send", "session_id": "...", "input": "print('hello')"}
   → Execute and read output
3. {"action": "close", "session_id": "..."}
   → Clean exit

Node.js REPL:
1. {"action": "open", "command": "node"}
2. {"action": "send", "session_id": "...", "input": "console.log('test')"}
3. {"action": "read", "session_id": "..."}

Claude Code:
1. {"action": "open", "command": "claude", "args": ["code"]}
2. {"action": "send", "session_id": "...", "input": "Create README"}
3. Wait for completion, then read output
